    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause and consequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Sehingga** connects a cause with its result. **Akibatnya** introduces a consequence; **supaya** introduces the purpose of an action."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Order and contrast",
     "texto": [
      "**Lalu**, **kemudian** and **setelah itu** order actions. **Bukan hanya .., melainkan juga ..** means \"not only .., but also ..\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
